WEBVTT

01:44.560 --> 01:45.400
Uncle Mingyu.

01:45.880 --> 01:47.600
- Here.
- Come on. Slowly.

01:50.840 --> 01:51.680
Careful.

01:52.320 --> 01:53.840
There you go. Be careful now.

02:00.280 --> 02:02.040
My lady, are we going
to just leave like this?

02:02.120 --> 02:04.880
What if we wait a bit longer?
We'll knock on people's doors again.

02:04.960 --> 02:08.199
That's right.
Maybe we spoke poorly last night.

02:08.280 --> 02:09.280
If we go again now,

02:09.360 --> 02:12.200
perhaps some folks will help us.

02:12.280 --> 02:13.480
Let's not trouble them anymore.

02:13.560 --> 02:14.400
Let's go.

02:30.040 --> 02:31.000
Halt!

02:32.360 --> 02:33.680
Who's blocking the road ahead?

02:34.160 --> 02:36.160
How dare you stop
the Vice Minister of Justice's carriage!

02:36.240 --> 02:37.240
What's going on?

02:37.320 --> 02:39.920
Mr. Wei, it seems like
the prison breakers are ahead.

02:41.200 --> 02:42.400
WEI QIAN

02:47.600 --> 02:50.240
I've heard rumors before.
But I didn't believe them.

02:50.800 --> 02:52.640
In broad daylight,

02:52.720 --> 02:53.880
someone dared

02:53.960 --> 02:57.240
to take a death-row prisoner.

03:04.360 --> 03:05.200
Sir,

03:06.400 --> 03:09.120
I'm the daughter
of the Chief Secretariat, Jiang Li.

03:09.200 --> 03:11.320
There's injustice in the corruption case

03:11.400 --> 03:12.440
of Magistrate Xue Huaiyuan.

03:13.360 --> 03:15.680
I want to take Magistrate Xue
to the capital to seek justice.

03:15.760 --> 03:18.680
The Jiang family will take responsibility
for any consequences.

03:18.760 --> 03:20.720
- Please let him go.
- Arrest the death-row prisoner.

03:20.800 --> 03:21.680
- Yes!
- Sir.

03:22.840 --> 03:24.240
Can you allow me to finish speaking?

03:24.320 --> 03:27.000
I've been ordered to execute Xue Huaiyuan.

03:27.080 --> 03:30.640
Today, in Huaixiang,
I'll only speak to officials.

03:30.720 --> 03:33.000
I advise you to step back

03:33.080 --> 03:35.280
and not hinder me
in the execution of my duties.

03:35.360 --> 03:38.080
Since ancient times,
people study to become officials

03:38.800 --> 03:40.000
to serve the people.

03:40.080 --> 03:41.480
Yet you said

03:41.560 --> 03:43.160
you would only speak to the officials.

03:43.240 --> 03:44.480
You sounded noble,

03:44.560 --> 03:46.200
but you're actually belittling the people.

03:46.280 --> 03:48.920
- How can those in Huaixiang seek justice?
- How impetuous!

03:49.000 --> 03:52.400
I admit I impetuously committed a crime
for taking a death row prisoner.

03:52.480 --> 03:53.440
But what about you, sir?

03:53.520 --> 03:55.720
You don't investigate,
refuse to listen to the truth,

03:56.200 --> 03:58.240
and execute innocent people.

03:58.320 --> 03:59.480
Is that not a crime?

03:59.560 --> 04:01.880
I could have spared you

04:02.360 --> 04:05.400
since you're young and naive,
but harbor sincerity

04:05.480 --> 04:07.200
for Chancellor Jiang's sake.

04:07.720 --> 04:09.360
But you're arrogant.

04:09.440 --> 04:12.120
How dare you openly reproach
an imperial court official?

04:12.200 --> 04:14.080
Enough is enough!

04:14.160 --> 04:16.240
If there's another way
to redress the injustice,

04:16.839 --> 04:18.079
I don't need to do this

04:19.360 --> 04:21.760
and put myself at your mercy.

04:22.400 --> 04:23.760
I have no other choice.

04:30.400 --> 04:33.400
The daughter of the Chief Secretariat
and Grand Preceptor, Jiang Li,

04:34.760 --> 04:36.720
broke Xue Huaiyuan out of jail.

04:37.320 --> 04:39.960
The evidence
is conclusive and irrefutable.

04:41.560 --> 04:43.680
I request to be taken
to the Court of Judicial Review.

04:43.760 --> 04:45.280
I ask that the Court of Judicial Review

04:45.360 --> 04:46.600
conduct a joint trial

04:46.680 --> 04:49.360
for my breaking a prisoner out of jail
and Xue Huaiyuan's corruption.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.200
- Please hold a joint trial.
- Please hold a joint trial.

04:55.080 --> 04:56.600
Incredible.

04:56.680 --> 05:00.320
You're willing to risk your lives
to delay a death-row prisoner's death.

05:01.320 --> 05:02.160
Is it worth it?

05:02.720 --> 05:03.560
Yes.

05:05.880 --> 05:07.280
I have no other choice.

05:09.280 --> 05:11.240
I must take Xue Huaiyuan to the capital.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.240
Even if I'm in chains,

05:15.200 --> 05:17.880
I must seek justice for him.

05:17.960 --> 05:20.960
This is an important matter
and you can't change it.

05:21.040 --> 05:22.600
Even if Chancellor Jiang is here,

05:22.680 --> 05:24.560
he cannot ignore the nation's laws.

05:25.080 --> 05:26.280
At this point,

05:26.360 --> 05:28.760
I still advise you

05:28.840 --> 05:29.680
to stop this

05:30.640 --> 05:33.240
and not tarnish
Chancellor Jiang's reputation.

05:34.120 --> 05:35.240
Guards.

05:35.320 --> 05:37.040
Take the death-row prisoner.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.480
Sir.

05:39.040 --> 05:40.600
Magistrate Xue is really innocent.

05:40.680 --> 05:42.760
We were the officers
who served under Magistrate Xue.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.480
We can testify for him.

05:44.560 --> 05:45.960
Our names are registered.

05:46.440 --> 05:48.560
We're willing to testify
for Magistrate Xue.

05:48.640 --> 05:50.720
- We're willing to testify.
- We're willing to testify.

05:50.800 --> 05:51.680
Enough talk.

05:52.280 --> 05:53.800
- Arrest him.
- Yes!

05:53.880 --> 05:54.880
Sir.

05:55.400 --> 05:56.280
Get up.

05:56.760 --> 05:57.880
- On your feet.
- Get up now!

05:59.960 --> 06:01.280
- Let go of me.
- Don't move.

06:01.880 --> 06:02.720
Xue Li.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.360
Xue Li.

06:07.240 --> 06:10.360
Escort the death-row prisoner Xue Huaiyuan
to the execution ground.

06:10.440 --> 06:11.400
- Yes.
- Yes.

06:12.160 --> 06:13.000
- Sir!
- Stop!

06:13.080 --> 06:14.120
- Magistrate Xue was framed!
- Stop!

06:14.200 --> 06:15.560
- Sir, someone framed him.
- Stop!

06:15.640 --> 06:17.040
- He is innocent!
- Let him go!

06:17.120 --> 06:18.920
- Sir, let him go!
- Let Magistrate Xue go.

06:19.000 --> 06:21.200
- Magistrate Xue is innocent!
- Let him go!

06:21.280 --> 06:23.600
- Let Magistrate Xue go!
- Xue Li.

06:24.600 --> 06:26.640
Let Magistrate Xue go!

06:35.120 --> 06:37.080
I'm Zhang, a butcher in Huaixiang.

06:38.280 --> 06:41.560
Zhang, I'm a cripple.

06:41.640 --> 06:44.400
I can't walk this path of seeking justice.

06:44.920 --> 06:45.920
Magistrate Xue did

06:46.560 --> 06:49.600
so much good for us.

06:50.120 --> 06:51.480
When you were bullied,

06:51.560 --> 06:54.040
it was Magistrate Xue who helped you.

06:54.120 --> 06:55.160
I've come to ask you

06:55.800 --> 06:58.120
to lead the people

06:58.600 --> 07:02.120
to speak up for Magistrate Xue.

07:02.200 --> 07:05.680
We must have a conscience.

07:06.440 --> 07:07.520
I'm sorry

07:07.600 --> 07:08.720
for being a coward.

07:08.800 --> 07:10.240
Cripple Liu came to see me yesterday

07:10.320 --> 07:11.520
and his scolding woke me up.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.400
I'm just a butcher.

07:13.960 --> 07:15.320
I may not excel in anything else.

07:15.400 --> 07:17.560
But I have steady hands and footing.

07:17.640 --> 07:20.840
Today, I stand firm right here!

07:20.920 --> 07:22.440
Without Magistrate Xue,

07:22.520 --> 07:24.520
the people of Huaixiang
wouldn't be who we are today.

07:24.600 --> 07:26.760
I, Zhang Sheng, am stepping up today.

07:26.840 --> 07:28.920
I have no family and I'm all alone anyway.

07:29.000 --> 07:31.280
All I have are these two butcher knives!

07:31.360 --> 07:33.880
With these knives,
I speak up for Magistrate Xue

07:33.960 --> 07:37.760
and the people of Huaixiang
to demand justice!

07:38.400 --> 07:40.520
You dare to obstruct me.

07:40.600 --> 07:41.640
Arrest him too.

07:42.800 --> 07:44.760
If you're arresting him, arrest me too.

07:44.840 --> 07:45.840
Yes, arrest all of us.

07:49.040 --> 07:51.840
Magistrate Xue, we've failed you.

07:51.920 --> 07:55.160
In the past, Feng Yutang harmed us,

07:55.720 --> 07:57.160
which made us really afraid,

07:57.800 --> 07:59.640
so we stopped intervening.

08:00.440 --> 08:02.880
But the heavens watch us all.

08:03.360 --> 08:05.840
If we watch you die unjustly,

08:06.360 --> 08:08.960
we will forever live with guilt.

08:16.320 --> 08:18.040
What are you doing?

08:18.640 --> 08:20.360
After we fled the famine,

08:21.400 --> 08:23.160
we would have died

08:23.240 --> 08:24.800
without Magistrate Xue's help.

08:24.880 --> 08:25.840
I must save him.

08:26.320 --> 08:27.800
Then earlier, why did you…

08:27.880 --> 08:28.920
Stay at home.

08:30.120 --> 08:32.200
I don't want you to die.

08:32.840 --> 08:35.159
Magistrate Xue was framed.

08:35.240 --> 08:36.159
Please judge fairly.

08:37.240 --> 08:38.240
Fine.

08:38.760 --> 08:42.120
I will arrest every single person
who comes here today.

08:42.200 --> 08:43.120
Arrest them.

08:43.200 --> 08:44.039
Wait!

08:44.120 --> 08:45.360
Arrest us too!

08:45.840 --> 08:47.800
Yes, arrest us too.

08:47.880 --> 08:48.920
- Arrest all of us!
- Dai Yun.

08:49.400 --> 08:50.240
I'm sorry.

08:50.720 --> 08:52.200
I was too cowardly yesterday.

08:53.520 --> 08:57.040
Mother, why aren't we saving Mr. Xue?

08:57.120 --> 08:58.920
We're powerless.

08:59.000 --> 09:01.480
But Mr. Xue helped you
deal with those bad men

09:01.560 --> 09:03.200
and bought candied haws for me.

09:03.280 --> 09:04.760
If you're not going, I'll go.

09:04.840 --> 09:05.720
Wait.

09:07.120 --> 09:10.160
Ping'an, what if they take you away again

09:10.240 --> 09:11.760
when you go to save Mr. Xue?

09:11.840 --> 09:12.920
I'm not scared.

09:13.000 --> 09:14.960
Mother, you shouldn't be scared either.

09:16.400 --> 09:19.720
I live in Unit 15 of Qingshi Alley.
My name is Dai Yun.

09:20.800 --> 09:21.840
I can also testify

09:21.920 --> 09:23.640
that Magistrate Xue
didn't commit corruption.

09:24.640 --> 09:26.360
It was his replacement, Feng Yutang,

09:26.440 --> 09:28.640
who withheld food
and mistreated the people.

09:28.720 --> 09:29.760
You all

09:30.320 --> 09:31.640
won't listen, right?

09:32.200 --> 09:35.560
Today, I'll arrest all those who come.

09:35.640 --> 09:38.200
Every one of you!

09:38.280 --> 09:39.320
Don't forget me.

09:39.960 --> 09:41.120
Mother, come.

09:43.200 --> 09:46.480
I am Mo Wenxuan,
living in Unit 3 of Qingshi Alley.

09:47.040 --> 09:49.360
The corruption charge
against Magistrate Xue is unjust.

09:49.440 --> 09:52.200
I'm willing to write a petition
and seek justice for him.

09:52.280 --> 09:53.560
- Justice for him!
- Justice for him!

09:53.640 --> 09:56.760
- Yes, justice for Magistrate Xue!
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!

09:56.840 --> 10:02.160
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!

10:02.240 --> 10:09.160
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!

10:09.240 --> 10:14.560
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!

10:14.640 --> 10:20.040
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!
- Justice for Magistrate Xue!

10:20.120 --> 10:21.880
You all won't listen, right?

10:21.960 --> 10:24.600
Sir, we have lived in Huaixiang
for generations.

10:24.680 --> 10:26.760
Sir, we're willing to seek justice
for Magistrate Xue.

10:26.840 --> 10:28.640
Please allow Ms. Jiang Li to pass!

10:28.720 --> 10:34.200
- Allow Ms. Jiang Li to pass!
- Allow Ms. Jiang Li to pass!

10:34.280 --> 10:37.000
Ms. Jiang Li, don't say I didn't warn you!

10:37.080 --> 10:39.000
- If you can't overturn the case
- Let her pass!

10:39.080 --> 10:41.560
and the Court of Judicial Review
meets with the Three Departments

10:41.640 --> 10:43.480
and rejects it, you will also face death!

10:43.560 --> 10:44.960
- Let's go!
- Allow her to pass!

10:45.040 --> 10:46.640
- Let her pass!
- Let her pass!

10:54.760 --> 10:56.960
- Let her pass!
- Let her pass!

11:08.920 --> 11:10.840
I really don't know what to say.

11:11.920 --> 11:14.760
My lady, you don't need to say anything.

11:14.840 --> 11:16.520
You've already done so much.

11:18.080 --> 11:20.080
We can't just watch you send yourself

11:20.720 --> 11:23.040
to the Court of Judicial Review.

11:23.120 --> 11:25.960
You are a dignified and noble person.

11:26.560 --> 11:30.040
We want you to remain clean,

11:30.120 --> 11:34.640
innocent, safe, and sound.

11:35.320 --> 11:38.280
Clean, innocent,

11:39.480 --> 11:40.960
safe, and sound.

11:41.040 --> 11:42.120
My lady, rest assured.

11:42.680 --> 11:44.560
We will do anything

11:45.880 --> 11:47.720
to reverse Magistrate Xue's verdict.

11:48.280 --> 11:50.000
Reverse Magistrate Xue's verdict!

11:50.080 --> 11:53.960
- Reverse Magistrate Xue's verdict!
- Reverse Magistrate Xue's verdict!

11:54.040 --> 11:58.960
- Reverse Magistrate Xue's verdict!
- Reverse Magistrate Xue's verdict!

12:03.160 --> 12:05.160
My lord, aren't you going to see her off?

12:06.600 --> 12:08.680
Since her task is done,

12:09.360 --> 12:10.680
there's no need for me to go.

12:11.480 --> 12:12.760
I have something to say.

12:14.640 --> 12:16.040
Ms. Jiang Li

12:16.120 --> 12:16.960
is this.

12:23.880 --> 12:25.080
Do you want to get 11 canes?

12:27.240 --> 12:28.600
I'm afraid it's not that easy.

12:29.240 --> 12:30.480
Some people

12:30.560 --> 12:32.200
won't let her easily take

12:32.280 --> 12:33.760
the folks to the capital.

12:34.440 --> 12:36.920
Then should we escort her all the way?

12:37.000 --> 12:39.480
This is beyond what we can do alone.

12:39.560 --> 12:41.640
Are there things
that we can't solve alone?

12:42.880 --> 12:45.280
Lu Ji, prepare paper and ink for me.

12:46.320 --> 12:48.360
- I want to write two secret letters.
- Yes.

13:11.160 --> 13:12.880
YE RESIDENCE

13:12.960 --> 13:16.240
The details of the Huaixiang incident
are complex and lengthy.

13:16.720 --> 13:19.880
Father must have heard and worried
about it for a long time.

13:20.400 --> 13:22.880
Please present this letter to my father

13:22.960 --> 13:26.000
and tell him Uncle Mingyu is with me,
keeping me safe.

13:26.520 --> 13:27.480
Please do not worry.

13:27.560 --> 13:29.760
Young Master, a secret letter
from Huaixiang.

13:30.360 --> 13:31.840
- Just leave it there for now.
- Yes.

13:46.520 --> 13:48.200
Twenty-three people from Huaixiang are

13:48.280 --> 13:50.520
willing to seek justice
for former Magistrate Xue Huaiyuan.

13:51.000 --> 13:53.680
They're angry
at the miscarriage of justice.

13:53.760 --> 13:56.360
I couldn't just be an onlooker,
so I joined them.

13:57.160 --> 14:00.600
Everything is currently fine.
Father, please don't worry.

14:02.080 --> 14:03.280
Outrageous!

14:03.360 --> 14:06.040
Since ancient times, trying to overturn
a convicted official's verdict

14:06.120 --> 14:08.640
is like accusing the authorities
and challenging those in power.

14:09.200 --> 14:13.000
How many times has this ended
in a futile and bloody affair?

14:13.640 --> 14:15.560
She has no idea
how serious the situation is!

14:15.640 --> 14:16.480
Chancellor Jiang,

14:17.040 --> 14:19.120
I was worried
when I heard the news in the capital too.

14:19.600 --> 14:21.960
But fortunately,
Uncle Mingyu is with Jiang Li.

14:22.040 --> 14:23.520
Uncle Mingyu wrote to me,

14:23.600 --> 14:25.480
praising her bravery and wisdom.

14:25.560 --> 14:28.000
The people of Huaixiang
are all cheering for her

14:28.080 --> 14:29.160
and the Jiang family.

14:29.240 --> 14:30.120
Vice Director Ye.

14:35.760 --> 14:38.880
You're still young and perhaps unaware
of the gravity of this situation.

14:39.720 --> 14:41.880
Every cheer from the people

14:41.960 --> 14:43.280
for the Jiang family

14:43.360 --> 14:45.280
is like a slap to the Minister of Justice.

14:45.360 --> 14:47.960
It's like getting my husband into trouble.

14:51.200 --> 14:53.080
Li'er's actions are sure worrisome.

14:53.160 --> 14:56.040
She didn't even
inform her parents beforehand.

14:56.840 --> 14:57.680
Dear,

14:57.760 --> 14:59.680
don't waste time worrying about her.

15:00.200 --> 15:01.760
This isn't the first time

15:02.320 --> 15:04.320
she acted recklessly
without regard to her parents.

15:04.400 --> 15:06.360
She even dared to stop
Ministry of Justice officials

15:06.440 --> 15:08.680
and had the nerve
to break a prisoner out of jail!

15:08.760 --> 15:09.680
Just wait.

15:10.840 --> 15:12.720
Scheming individuals in the capital

15:12.800 --> 15:16.560
could easily frame
the Jiang family for treason.

15:20.240 --> 15:23.680
Then we should send a letter to Li'er now.

15:23.760 --> 15:26.560
It's already too late.
Her letter has arrived.

15:26.640 --> 15:28.160
News has spread in the imperial court.

15:28.240 --> 15:30.600
I'm afraid His Majesty
will inquire about it soon.

15:31.160 --> 15:32.720
Do you have a plan to deal with this?

15:32.800 --> 15:34.360
- Ms. Sun.
- Yes.

15:34.440 --> 15:37.120
Send someone
to bring Jiang Li back immediately.

15:37.200 --> 15:38.200
Chancellor Jiang,

15:38.280 --> 15:40.080
Jiang Li is leading the people
to seek justice.

15:40.160 --> 15:42.080
If you bring her back by force,

15:42.720 --> 15:44.440
it might be hard
to explain it to the people.

15:44.520 --> 15:46.680
I'm heading south
for the disaster relief work.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.720
If you trust me,

15:48.800 --> 15:50.600
please allow me

15:50.680 --> 15:53.040
to reason and persuade her.

15:53.120 --> 15:55.240
I believe I can persuade her to return.

15:55.320 --> 15:58.400
Shijie, this is a serious matter.

15:58.920 --> 16:01.080
You are cousins
who are around the same age.

16:01.160 --> 16:04.480
You must ask Jiang Li
not to act rashly anymore!

16:12.040 --> 16:14.120
Your words worry me, dear.

16:14.200 --> 16:16.240
Can he persuade Li'er to return?

16:17.520 --> 16:18.960
Will the Jiang family be in danger?

16:20.000 --> 16:21.120
Let's wait and see.

16:21.640 --> 16:22.880
I'd rather this girl

16:23.560 --> 16:26.760
not return to the capital anytime soon.

16:28.560 --> 16:30.240
If she does return,

16:32.000 --> 16:34.000
there will be big trouble.

16:43.440 --> 16:44.320
Shijie!

16:45.640 --> 16:46.560
Why are you ignoring me?

16:46.640 --> 16:47.840
I'm thinking about Jiang Li.

16:47.920 --> 16:50.560
Shijie, take me with you.

16:51.120 --> 16:54.400
If we work together,
we can overcome anything.

16:55.040 --> 16:58.320
Shijie, take this for the road.

16:58.400 --> 17:00.600
If you're bored,
go back to your little turtle.

17:00.680 --> 17:02.640
I'm going for relief work.
I have an official duty.

17:02.720 --> 17:03.920
Don't cause trouble.

17:07.880 --> 17:09.680
Shijie, taking me along won't hurt.

17:09.760 --> 17:10.880
I can also give you a hand.

17:10.960 --> 17:11.800
No.

17:11.880 --> 17:13.359
Come on. Take me with you.

17:13.440 --> 17:15.480
If you don't take me,
I'm not letting you leave.

17:15.560 --> 17:17.359
I don't have time to fool around.
Get off now.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.960
- No.
- You're not getting off?

17:19.040 --> 17:20.599
- No, I'm not.
- Fine.

17:22.119 --> 17:24.760
What are you doing?
Are you playing games with me?

17:30.000 --> 17:33.800
I just miss my cousin a lot.

17:33.880 --> 17:36.440
How could you be so heartless?

17:37.640 --> 17:39.040
Can you really stand

17:39.120 --> 17:43.240
to see me cry every day?

17:43.800 --> 17:46.360
Fine! Since you're so heartless,
don't blame me for being the same.

17:46.440 --> 17:48.360
Everyone, come and see!

17:48.440 --> 17:49.800
Ye Shijie

17:49.880 --> 17:52.720
is an ungrateful and heartless man.

17:52.800 --> 17:54.480
He turns his back on me

17:54.560 --> 17:55.400
and is ungrateful!

17:55.480 --> 17:57.120
Jiang Jingrui, are you sick in the head?

17:59.040 --> 18:01.760
Shijie, you finally realized I'm sick.

18:01.840 --> 18:04.400
My illness has seeped deep into my bones.

18:04.480 --> 18:06.040
It's incurable.

18:06.120 --> 18:07.440
If you don't take me with you,

18:08.680 --> 18:10.080
you will never see me again.

18:10.160 --> 18:11.440
That would be wonderful.

18:13.040 --> 18:15.520
Ye Shijie, you're so cruel!

18:15.600 --> 18:17.720
You're so heartless, Ye Shijie.

18:18.640 --> 18:19.760
You're heartless!

18:20.320 --> 18:21.560
Yes, you!

18:22.120 --> 18:23.840
Ye Shijie!

18:24.720 --> 18:25.960
Pack up and get in the carriage.

18:27.000 --> 18:29.160
I'll go and pack right now!

18:29.240 --> 18:30.080
Let's go.

18:31.000 --> 18:33.680
Wait! Aren't you going to wait for me?

18:33.760 --> 18:34.800
Ye Shijie!

18:35.480 --> 18:39.200
Your Majesty, this drought
spans several counties.

18:39.280 --> 18:40.480
It has a wide range

18:40.560 --> 18:42.280
and has affected
tens of thousands of people.

18:42.360 --> 18:44.680
But rest assured.

18:44.760 --> 18:46.920
The surrounding counties

18:47.000 --> 18:49.240
have enough grain in their reserves.

18:49.320 --> 18:52.280
The only issue is the lack of manpower
to transport the grain.

18:52.360 --> 18:54.520
I am urgently arranging people

18:54.600 --> 18:56.280
to ensure the disaster
does not lead to famine.

18:56.360 --> 18:57.920
Minister Li, I trust your capabilities.

18:58.520 --> 19:00.920
Two years ago, you managed
the southwest floods effectively,

19:01.000 --> 19:02.080
saving many lives

19:02.160 --> 19:04.000
and easing much suffering.

19:04.080 --> 19:05.880
You are indeed a pillar of the nation.

19:05.960 --> 19:08.800
I entrust my people to you once again.

19:08.880 --> 19:10.440
I will do my best, Your Majesty.

19:12.360 --> 19:13.240
Minister Jiang,

19:14.720 --> 19:17.120
do you have anything to say to me?

19:17.200 --> 19:20.880
I am deeply worried.

19:20.960 --> 19:23.800
My daughter broke
a prisoner out in Huaixiang.

19:23.880 --> 19:26.040
Her behavior is truly reckless.

19:26.120 --> 19:29.600
I have failed to educate my daughter
and I deserve to be punished.

19:29.680 --> 19:30.840
Minister Li.

19:30.920 --> 19:31.960
Yes, Your Majesty.

19:32.040 --> 19:33.960
What's the punishment
for breaking a prisoner out of jail?

19:34.040 --> 19:35.120
Your Majesty,

19:35.200 --> 19:37.800
according to the law, the punishment

19:37.880 --> 19:38.840
is death by beheading.

19:40.360 --> 19:44.000
Minister Jiang, I have reviewed
the memorials reproaching you.

19:45.600 --> 19:47.240
They contain plenty of harsh

19:47.320 --> 19:48.680
and sharp words,

19:48.760 --> 19:50.200
directly saying your crime
is unpardonable.

19:50.720 --> 19:52.520
They're so cruel.
I can't bear to read them.

19:52.600 --> 19:56.320
I am extremely concerned.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.360
Chief Secretariat Jiang,

19:57.440 --> 19:59.720
you're an important official
the late emperor entrusted to me.

19:59.800 --> 20:02.680
I cannot bring myself to punish you
without understanding the situation.

20:02.760 --> 20:04.800
I have decided to meet your daughter

20:05.400 --> 20:07.440
- before making a decision.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

20:12.640 --> 20:13.520
PRINCESS WANNING'S MANSION

20:13.600 --> 20:14.880
Do you know your mistake?

20:15.440 --> 20:18.760
Do you know your mistake? Do you?

20:18.840 --> 20:20.120
I'll beat you to death!

20:20.200 --> 20:22.000
Her Highness entrusted you

20:22.080 --> 20:24.000
with Huaixiang's affairs
because she valued you.

20:24.080 --> 20:26.280
But look at what you've done!

20:26.360 --> 20:29.520
Do you think you've lived up
to Her Highness' and my expectations?

20:29.600 --> 20:31.600
Do you know your mistake? Do you?

20:32.360 --> 20:34.200
Get up!

20:35.240 --> 20:37.880
I'll beat you to death!

20:38.440 --> 20:40.600
Chancellor, stop beating him.

20:41.160 --> 20:42.760
This child is pitiful.

20:44.000 --> 20:47.360
Your Highness,
I'm also at fault in this matter.

20:47.440 --> 20:49.880
Please punish me as well.

20:50.520 --> 20:52.280
Chancellor, come in quickly.

20:52.360 --> 20:53.960
Yes, Your Highness.

20:55.200 --> 20:57.040
Kneel here and reflect on your actions.

21:10.360 --> 21:11.360
Your Highness,

21:12.080 --> 21:14.800
I'll leave his life in your hands.

21:14.880 --> 21:16.920
You may decide how to deal with him.

21:17.000 --> 21:20.320
Guards, quickly dress him up

21:21.320 --> 21:22.360
and take him away.

21:25.960 --> 21:27.240
Thank you, Your Highness.

21:32.600 --> 21:33.920
Thank you, Your Highness.

21:34.000 --> 21:35.080
Meixiang,

21:35.720 --> 21:36.680
serve the tea.

21:36.760 --> 21:37.600
Yes, Your Highness.

21:41.160 --> 21:43.240
Chancellor, please take a seat.

21:43.320 --> 21:45.360
I dare not.

21:45.440 --> 21:46.640
I said sit.

21:52.920 --> 21:54.200
Let me pour it.

21:54.880 --> 21:55.720
I don't deserve it.

21:56.360 --> 21:59.360
Chancellor, this tribute tea
is of high quality.

22:02.560 --> 22:04.000
It's fragrant, Your Highness.

22:04.080 --> 22:05.160
Try it.

22:10.760 --> 22:12.000
It's overflowing, Your Highness.

22:13.680 --> 22:15.680
The gold mine in Huaixiang is gone.

22:16.360 --> 22:19.320
If I were Prince Cheng,
you would have been dead by now.

22:19.800 --> 22:24.360
If it weren't for your years
of loyal service to me,

22:25.360 --> 22:27.040
I wouldn't protect you too.

22:27.120 --> 22:29.600
But now, you've left me with this mess.

22:29.680 --> 22:32.680
Chancellor, what am I supposed to do now?

22:33.200 --> 22:34.280
Your Highness,

22:34.360 --> 22:35.640
Jiang Li may still be alive,

22:35.720 --> 22:38.200
but she committed a serious crime
of breaking a prisoner out of jail.

22:38.840 --> 22:40.640
I can use this
to bring down the Jiang family.

22:40.720 --> 22:43.560
It's like cutting off
one of His Majesty's arms.

22:43.640 --> 22:45.360
What if you can't bring them down?

22:45.440 --> 22:47.280
If the truth about the gold mine comes out

22:47.880 --> 22:50.080
when Jiang Li returns to the capital,

22:51.360 --> 22:53.320
I won't be able to protect you either.

22:53.400 --> 22:54.760
Then what do you…

22:55.920 --> 22:57.840
Meixiang, the tea is already cold.

22:58.880 --> 23:00.240
No, it's not.

23:00.320 --> 23:01.400
It has not turned cold.

23:05.960 --> 23:08.040
But His Majesty already
brought this matter up

23:08.120 --> 23:09.400
in the imperial court today.

23:09.480 --> 23:11.480
It might not be wise to kill her now.

23:13.920 --> 23:17.240
Chancellor, you must drink
the tribute tea while it's hot.

23:21.560 --> 23:23.280
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

23:24.160 --> 23:26.360
I will personally take action this time.

23:26.440 --> 23:28.400
Jiang Li will surely never return

23:28.480 --> 23:32.080
and I'll make sure
the Jiang family falls hard after that.

23:32.160 --> 23:33.080
I guarantee it.

23:34.280 --> 23:35.240
Don't.

23:39.480 --> 23:40.880
Don't disappoint me again.

23:55.200 --> 23:58.160
Has Shen Yurong come to see me these days?

23:58.920 --> 24:00.920
Your Highness, he hasn't.

24:03.680 --> 24:05.280
He can still maintain his composure.

24:06.400 --> 24:10.160
Let's see how long it'll take
for him to come.

24:10.720 --> 24:12.040
Ms. Jiang Li

24:12.120 --> 24:13.800
is truly astonishing,

24:13.880 --> 24:16.400
bringing a magistrate she barely knows
to petition to His Majesty.

24:16.480 --> 24:17.600
Yes. I wonder…

24:18.360 --> 24:19.280
- Mr. Shen.
- Mr. Shen.

24:27.320 --> 24:28.280
Prepare the carriage.

24:28.360 --> 24:29.200
Yes.

24:33.840 --> 24:34.680
Wait.

24:36.000 --> 24:36.840
There's no need.

24:45.080 --> 24:45.960
Here, enjoy.

24:46.040 --> 24:47.280
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

24:47.360 --> 24:48.200
Thank you very much.

24:48.720 --> 24:49.920
- Chief.
- Come on.

24:50.000 --> 24:51.760
- Here.
- Thank you for letting us rest here.

24:52.320 --> 24:55.160
- You see, there are so many of us.
- Here.

24:55.240 --> 24:56.520
We don't ask for quality food.

24:56.600 --> 24:58.240
As long as it can fill our stomachs,

24:58.320 --> 24:59.200
we'll take them.

24:59.680 --> 25:01.520
I'll pay double, all right?

25:01.600 --> 25:03.520
It's not that I don't want
to earn this money.

25:03.600 --> 25:05.840
But we don't have enough to eat at all.

25:05.920 --> 25:08.320
I don't know when the famine will end.

25:08.400 --> 25:11.200
If I give you everything now,
where will I find food later on?

25:11.280 --> 25:12.560
Please. I'm begging you.

25:13.080 --> 25:14.440
Please help us find a solution.

25:14.520 --> 25:16.320
Then I'll ask the neighbors for you.

25:22.880 --> 25:24.080
Here, have some water.

25:24.160 --> 25:25.320
Jiang Li.

25:25.800 --> 25:26.800
Get off the carriage and…

25:26.880 --> 25:28.960
All right. It's all right.

25:29.640 --> 25:30.560
- It's fine now.
- What's…

25:30.640 --> 25:32.520
It's all right now. There, there.

25:33.720 --> 25:39.560
A civet with spots

25:39.640 --> 25:46.480
Jumped over South Mountain

25:47.560 --> 25:54.240
Following the North Star

25:54.320 --> 25:56.480
She returned home to the border

25:59.920 --> 26:01.360
Don't you think you're being

26:02.120 --> 26:03.680
overly nice to Magistrate Xue?

26:03.760 --> 26:05.080
Even if you're repaying a favor,

26:05.160 --> 26:06.680
you don't have to be this protective.

26:07.400 --> 26:08.440
When we get to the capital,

26:08.920 --> 26:10.040
it might cause trouble

26:10.120 --> 26:11.920
if the Jiang family sees this.

26:12.000 --> 26:12.920
Uncle Mingyu,

26:14.160 --> 26:15.120
you should know

26:16.000 --> 26:19.160
that my father completely abandoned me
at Zhennv Hall for ten years.

26:19.880 --> 26:22.400
Magistrate Xue's daughter died
trying to save me.

26:23.240 --> 26:25.080
That's why I consider him my father.

26:25.640 --> 26:27.680
I know you're someone who repays kindness.

26:28.520 --> 26:29.960
But there's something

26:30.840 --> 26:32.160
I need your advice on now.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.080
What is it?

26:33.560 --> 26:35.280
Ever since we entered Dingzhou,

26:35.360 --> 26:37.560
every household along the way
is facing food shortages.

26:37.640 --> 26:38.920
I asked the village chief.

26:39.000 --> 26:40.800
He said the famine is worse
as we travel ahead.

26:40.880 --> 26:42.600
Didn't the imperial court
provide disaster relief?

26:42.680 --> 26:45.720
Yes, but only enough for each person
to have a bowl of watery porridge daily.

26:45.800 --> 26:46.880
Is there another route?

26:47.680 --> 26:49.000
We could detour through Liuzhou.

26:49.760 --> 26:51.960
But the capital is in the north.

26:52.040 --> 26:53.520
If we take a detour toward the west,

26:53.600 --> 26:55.680
it'll take at least a month more
to reach the capital.

26:55.760 --> 26:57.680
They are eager for us
to take a longer route

26:58.240 --> 26:59.920
so they can carry out
their plans in secret.

27:00.720 --> 27:03.000
Let's stick to Dingzhou
to avoid more trouble.

27:03.080 --> 27:04.840
We're a large group,
so provisions are a problem.

27:04.920 --> 27:05.800
Let's split up.

27:12.880 --> 27:15.240
My father and I trust all of you.

27:15.320 --> 27:18.400
Today, I ask you all to remember this.

27:18.480 --> 27:20.840
My identity now is Ms. Jiang Li.

27:20.920 --> 27:22.680
If you address me wrongly in the capital,

27:22.760 --> 27:24.320
not only will we fail to save my father,

27:24.400 --> 27:25.880
it will also endanger our lives.

27:25.960 --> 27:27.960
- All right. We'll remember that.
- All right. We got it.

27:28.040 --> 27:29.560
Please inform

27:29.640 --> 27:31.640
other people from Huaixiang
about my identity.

27:31.720 --> 27:34.280
Gu Da, those of you
who are skilled in martial arts

27:34.360 --> 27:35.560
must take good care of everyone

27:35.640 --> 27:36.760
and ensure their safety.

27:36.840 --> 27:38.760
Please rest assured.
Take care of yourself too.

27:38.840 --> 27:40.600
Let's meet again after leaving Dingzhou.

27:40.680 --> 27:41.560
Safe journey.

27:42.120 --> 27:42.960
Take care.

27:43.040 --> 27:43.880
Be careful.

27:43.960 --> 27:44.880
- Let's prepare to head out too.
- Careful.

27:44.960 --> 27:45.840
Come on, slowly.

27:48.880 --> 27:50.000
SOUTH GATE

27:50.080 --> 27:52.440
Everyone, line up. No need to rush.

27:52.520 --> 27:54.200
- Thank you.
- Next.

27:54.280 --> 27:55.160
DINGZHOU

27:55.240 --> 27:56.760
Everyone will get some. No pushing.

27:57.360 --> 27:58.200
Here you go.

27:58.280 --> 27:59.640
- It's still hot.
- Thank you.

27:59.720 --> 28:01.800
- Move forward after getting food.
- Here's yours, ma'am.

28:01.880 --> 28:02.760
Thank you.

28:03.240 --> 28:04.480
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

28:05.080 --> 28:06.240
- Thank you.
- Here you go.

28:06.320 --> 28:08.280
- Thank you.
- Those at the back, please line up.

28:09.480 --> 28:10.440
Hey, what are you doing?

28:10.920 --> 28:12.400
- It's mine!
- Don't grab it.

28:16.640 --> 28:17.560
Uncle Mingyu,

28:18.120 --> 28:20.920
let's go and buy
some food for the journey ahead.

28:21.000 --> 28:22.040
The price isn't a problem.

28:22.520 --> 28:23.560
No matter what,

28:24.520 --> 28:25.880
we must leave tomorrow morning.

28:25.960 --> 28:26.920
All right.

28:27.000 --> 28:28.080
Those at the back. Keep up.

28:33.080 --> 28:33.920
Jiang Li!

28:35.360 --> 28:36.320
Liu Xu?

28:39.160 --> 28:40.000
Liu Xu,

28:40.520 --> 28:43.640
what are you doing
in Dingzhou at this time?

28:43.720 --> 28:44.640
My father was ordered

28:44.720 --> 28:46.800
to escort relief supplies to Dingzhou,

28:46.880 --> 28:47.840
so I followed along.

28:48.680 --> 28:50.040
I thought our mission would be over

28:50.120 --> 28:51.440
once the provision was delivered.

28:51.520 --> 28:53.640
But Dingzhou's famine is so severe.

28:53.720 --> 28:55.360
The city's granaries are empty

28:55.440 --> 28:57.360
and many disaster victims gather
outside the city.

28:57.440 --> 28:59.880
The local officials in Dingzhou
are overwhelmed

28:59.960 --> 29:01.600
and lack the manpower to distribute food,

29:01.680 --> 29:03.560
so my father decided to stay

29:04.040 --> 29:06.080
and help distribute the food in Dingzhou.

29:06.160 --> 29:07.600
Is the situation really bad?

29:07.680 --> 29:08.880
Yes, it's quite serious.

29:08.960 --> 29:11.880
Earlier, they said a batch of supplies
was on the way.

29:11.960 --> 29:12.960
But it hasn't arrived yet.

29:13.040 --> 29:14.840
Without food,

29:14.920 --> 29:16.720
there might be unrest.

29:16.800 --> 29:18.240
You have to be careful.

29:19.280 --> 29:20.760
After all, people would do anything

29:20.840 --> 29:21.960
to survive.

29:22.040 --> 29:24.640
I expected this
when I saw the disaster victims

29:24.720 --> 29:25.840
on the way here,

29:26.760 --> 29:29.360
so I told people from Huaixiang
to take a detour.

29:29.440 --> 29:30.880
There are only a few of us now.

29:31.360 --> 29:32.920
We'll leave early tomorrow morning.

29:34.760 --> 29:36.280
I thought we could catch up

29:36.360 --> 29:37.800
this time.

29:37.880 --> 29:39.320
But you're leaving again.

29:39.800 --> 29:41.120
You don't know

29:41.200 --> 29:43.360
how bored I was in the capital.

29:43.440 --> 29:46.760
Aren't Ye Shijie and Jiang Jingrui
in the capital?

29:46.840 --> 29:48.440
Don't even mention Jiang Jingrui to me.

29:48.520 --> 29:50.040
All he does is upset me.

29:50.520 --> 29:52.840
I feel like giving him a piece of my mind
whenever I see him.

29:53.600 --> 29:55.360
Ye Shijie is a bookworm.

29:55.440 --> 29:57.240
He's always busy with official matters.

29:57.320 --> 29:58.720
I don't really get to see him.

29:58.800 --> 30:00.640
He just started
in the Ministry of Revenue after all.

30:01.240 --> 30:03.280
Maybe he's not a bookworm.

30:03.360 --> 30:05.440
He's just not interested in me.

30:05.520 --> 30:07.960
Are you moving on?

30:08.480 --> 30:10.840
I only like people who like me back.

30:10.920 --> 30:13.840
As for those who aren't interested in me,
I won't waste my time on them.

30:18.480 --> 30:19.440
- Open the door!
- Open up!

30:19.520 --> 30:20.880
We want to see Ms. Jiang Li!

30:21.640 --> 30:23.880
- Open up!
- Ms. Jiang Li.

30:23.960 --> 30:25.600
- My lady!
- Mr. Ye, what should we do now?

30:25.680 --> 30:27.680
- How did they know Jiang Li's here?
- I have no idea.

30:27.760 --> 30:30.200
Could the lady who found this place for us
have told them?

30:30.280 --> 30:32.160
Or maybe the villagers leaked it out.

30:32.240 --> 30:33.080
Impossible.

30:34.000 --> 30:34.840
Mr. Ye,

30:34.920 --> 30:36.360
why don't I ask Ms. Jiang Li to come

30:36.440 --> 30:37.440
and calm them down?

30:37.520 --> 30:39.800
No, Jiang Li can't appear right now.

30:41.000 --> 30:41.880
I'll meet them.

30:42.360 --> 30:43.200
Open the door.

30:43.280 --> 30:44.120
Ms. Jiang Li.

30:44.200 --> 30:45.200
Someone is coming.

30:45.280 --> 30:46.960
Everyone, let's go and see Ms. Jiang Li.

30:51.800 --> 30:53.120
What a crowd.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.560
Are you trying to rob us?

30:54.640 --> 30:56.160
No. We dare not, sir.

30:56.240 --> 30:57.280
We just want

30:57.360 --> 30:58.560
to see Ms. Jiang Li.

30:58.640 --> 30:59.720
Who told you she's here?

31:00.280 --> 31:01.360
I heard about it.

31:01.440 --> 31:02.480
From whom?

31:02.560 --> 31:03.840
I really heard it

31:04.360 --> 31:05.760
from the beggars.

31:05.840 --> 31:07.680
They said she is ready to uphold justice

31:07.760 --> 31:09.560
and petition to His Majesty
for the magistrate,

31:09.640 --> 31:10.880
so she can definitely help us.

31:10.960 --> 31:12.560
All of us agreed to come and see her.

31:12.640 --> 31:14.160
We want to ask Ms. Jiang Li

31:14.240 --> 31:16.640
to help us get some food.

31:16.720 --> 31:19.200
- That's right.
- Please help us, Ms. Jiang Li.

31:19.280 --> 31:20.680
- Ms. Jiang Li!
- Ms. Jiang Li!

31:20.760 --> 31:21.600
Shut up!

31:23.160 --> 31:25.280
You've been tricked. Get it?

31:25.360 --> 31:26.280
Leave.

31:26.360 --> 31:27.520
We don't have food either.

31:27.600 --> 31:28.520
Ms. Jiang Li!

31:46.920 --> 31:50.400
Sir, please have mercy on us

31:50.480 --> 31:52.560
and give us some food.

31:53.040 --> 31:55.040
My child is only a year old.

31:55.120 --> 31:56.280
I don't have to eat.

31:56.360 --> 31:58.600
But please save my child.

31:58.680 --> 32:01.040
Please. I can go without food.

32:01.120 --> 32:03.520
Please help my child.

32:04.240 --> 32:05.560
Please. I beg you.

32:05.640 --> 32:07.160
Please help my child.

32:12.080 --> 32:13.960
Give us some food.

32:15.240 --> 32:16.680
Please.

32:17.760 --> 32:19.440
- Go and get some steamed buns.
- Yes.

32:20.760 --> 32:24.360
Sir, please help the children.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.280
Get up.

32:26.480 --> 32:28.560
Sir, please.

32:29.560 --> 32:31.560
Please. I beg you.

32:31.640 --> 32:33.080
Please, sir.

32:33.760 --> 32:35.080
We don't have much food either.

32:36.320 --> 32:38.200
We can only share some with the children.

32:38.280 --> 32:39.840
Those able-bodied adults

32:40.640 --> 32:41.680
should leave now.

32:43.400 --> 32:44.240
Otherwise,

32:45.880 --> 32:47.360
don't blame me for being rude.

32:47.440 --> 32:52.400
- Thank you, sir.
- Thank you, Ms. Jiang Li.

32:52.480 --> 32:54.200
- Thank you.
- Thank you, sir.

33:00.440 --> 33:02.960
Jiang Li, what are you doing?

33:03.040 --> 33:05.040
Uncle Mingyu, did you give
the disaster victim food?

33:05.120 --> 33:07.200
I gave the children some steamed buns

33:07.280 --> 33:09.040
and chased away the rest.

33:09.120 --> 33:10.600
You shouldn't have given them food.

33:10.680 --> 33:12.480
I know we're running out of food.

33:12.560 --> 33:13.520
I did leave some for us.

33:13.600 --> 33:14.440
Besides,

33:14.520 --> 33:16.120
I can eat less during the journey.

33:16.200 --> 33:17.480
That was not what I meant.

33:18.840 --> 33:20.520
No matter how much food we have,

33:20.600 --> 33:22.120
you shouldn't give it to others.

33:22.200 --> 33:24.600
The moment we give them food,

33:24.680 --> 33:26.040
we can't control the crowd later.

33:26.120 --> 33:28.160
The disaster victims
have been hungry for a long time.

33:28.240 --> 33:30.200
Once they catch on
and come again as a group,

33:30.680 --> 33:31.760
we won't be able to leave.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.840
Don't worry. I'm here.

33:34.920 --> 33:36.680
Anyone causing trouble
won't get away with it.

33:36.760 --> 33:38.400
What if it's the whole city's
disaster victims?

33:38.480 --> 33:39.760
How will you handle them alone?

33:39.840 --> 33:40.680
I…

33:41.560 --> 33:43.360
Before the news spread,

33:43.440 --> 33:44.600
we must leave now.

33:45.120 --> 33:46.840
I'll have Liu Xu help us
to leave the city.

33:48.360 --> 33:51.040
If the people asking for food today
are from Huaixiang,

33:51.600 --> 33:52.840
will you still be indifferent?

33:53.720 --> 33:55.440
Uncle Mingyu, what do you mean?

33:56.640 --> 33:58.000
I thought you were kindhearted

33:58.760 --> 34:01.320
and took the risk to save
the people of Huaixiang out of gratitude.

34:01.400 --> 34:03.120
But now, it seems it's not the case.

34:03.600 --> 34:04.760
Your attitude changed

34:05.320 --> 34:06.960
when it comes to people from another city.

34:10.480 --> 34:11.679
We have our priorities.

34:12.239 --> 34:14.760
What we must do now
is to hurry back to the capital.

34:15.400 --> 34:17.840
We can't let the people of Huaixiang
who departed early wait in vain.

34:22.679 --> 34:24.960
Never mind. You've always been decisive.

34:26.520 --> 34:27.440
Let's do what you say.

34:32.520 --> 34:33.400
Tong'er.

34:37.320 --> 34:38.199
Time to go.

34:40.760 --> 34:41.600
Let them pass.

34:45.840 --> 34:46.679
Jiang Li,

34:46.760 --> 34:48.600
be careful once you leave here.

34:48.679 --> 34:50.760
If there's an emergency,
write to me immediately.

34:52.560 --> 34:54.440
Take care. I'll see you in the capital.

34:54.520 --> 34:55.600
You should go now.

34:58.280 --> 34:59.560
Uncle Mingyu, let's go.

34:59.640 --> 35:00.560
All right.

35:05.480 --> 35:09.280
DINGZHOU

35:20.360 --> 35:21.680
Is that Ms. Jiang Li's carriage?

35:21.760 --> 35:23.360
- Yes.
- It's Ms. Jiang Li's carriage.

35:23.440 --> 35:25.360
- Ms. Jiang Li!
- Ms. Jiang Li!

35:25.440 --> 35:26.400
Drat.

35:26.480 --> 35:27.920
- Ms. Jiang Li!
- We're in trouble.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.440
Ms. Jiang Li!

35:30.520 --> 35:32.000
It's Ms. Jiang Li's carriage!

35:32.080 --> 35:33.320
It's Ms. Jiang Li's carriage!

35:34.800 --> 35:36.000
What do you want?

35:37.720 --> 35:38.600
What do you want?

35:39.080 --> 35:40.600
Get up!

35:40.680 --> 35:41.640
Listen to me.

35:41.720 --> 35:43.280
There's no Ms. Jiang Li here.

35:43.360 --> 35:45.480
I don't even know who Ms. Jiang Li is.

35:45.560 --> 35:47.440
You're lying! Ms. Jiang Li is inside.

35:47.520 --> 35:49.160
Yes, there must be food in the carriage!

35:49.240 --> 35:51.640
- Let's go and get it! There's food inside!
- What are you doing?

35:52.320 --> 35:53.160
Back off!

35:53.960 --> 35:55.000
- Tong'er.
- What are you doing?

35:55.600 --> 35:56.720
Ms. Jiang!

35:56.800 --> 35:57.680
- There's food inside!
- Move!

35:58.320 --> 36:00.200
If you come up, I won't play nice anymore!

36:01.400 --> 36:02.680
- It's going to topple!
- Get off!

36:02.760 --> 36:04.480
Uncle Mingyu, are you all right?

36:04.560 --> 36:06.800
It's Ms. Jiang Li! It's her!

36:08.280 --> 36:09.120
Get out of the way!

36:13.880 --> 36:15.040
I dare you to get close again!

36:18.120 --> 36:19.680
Everyone, don't believe him.

36:19.760 --> 36:21.000
We can't die from hunger.

36:21.080 --> 36:22.440
There must be food in the carriage.

36:22.520 --> 36:23.760
Let's go and get it.

36:25.080 --> 36:26.480
Go and take it!

36:27.480 --> 36:28.840
It's better than starving to death.

36:29.600 --> 36:31.240
What are you waiting for? Go!

36:38.960 --> 36:39.920
We're giving out food!

36:40.440 --> 36:42.480
Everyone, look! We're giving out food!

36:42.560 --> 36:43.600
Where?

36:43.680 --> 36:45.480
Tasty jumbo steamed buns!

36:46.600 --> 36:47.920
Jumbo steamed buns!

36:48.000 --> 36:49.160
Come quickly!

36:49.760 --> 36:51.280
There's filling inside!

36:51.360 --> 36:52.640
- Where?
- Steamed buns.

36:53.360 --> 36:54.560
- Come and see.
- What now?

36:54.640 --> 36:55.800
Tasty jumbo steamed buns!

36:55.880 --> 36:57.000
These have fillings!

36:57.080 --> 36:57.960
Really?

36:58.040 --> 36:59.880
- It's really steamed buns.
- They're delicious!

36:59.960 --> 37:01.720
Come and get some before they're gone.

37:02.240 --> 37:04.120
- Steamed buns!
- There are really steamed buns!

37:04.200 --> 37:05.800
- Jumbo steamed buns!
- Give me some!

37:05.880 --> 37:07.680
They'll run out if you're late.
Come quickly!

37:07.760 --> 37:11.000
- He's giving out food!
- I want steamed buns!

37:11.080 --> 37:12.080
I want steamed buns!

37:12.640 --> 37:13.680
- There's enough for everyone.
- I want one.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.360
- Don't grab them.
- All right, here you go.

37:16.000 --> 37:17.240
Uncle Mingyu, are you all right?

37:17.760 --> 37:19.960
- Shijie.
- Jiang Li, go now.

37:20.040 --> 37:21.000
We'll cover you.

37:23.440 --> 37:24.480
Thank you.

37:24.560 --> 37:26.120
- It's nothing.
- Be careful along the way.

37:27.440 --> 37:28.640
My steamed bun!

37:28.720 --> 37:29.680
Give it to me!

37:30.280 --> 37:31.360
- No!
- You old fool!

37:31.440 --> 37:32.360
- You two…
- Stop it.

37:32.440 --> 37:34.000
- Go away!
- Be careful.

37:34.080 --> 37:35.200
- Stop.
- Why did Magistrate Xue come down?

37:35.280 --> 37:36.440
- Don't!
- Magistrate Xue.

37:36.520 --> 37:37.600
Stop it.

37:37.680 --> 37:38.600
- Be careful.
- No.

37:38.680 --> 37:39.520
Slow…

37:39.600 --> 37:40.440
Slow down.

37:42.960 --> 37:44.120
Go away!

37:44.200 --> 37:45.400
- I want steamed buns.
- Careful.

37:45.480 --> 37:46.960
- No, don't!
- Magistrate Xue!

37:47.040 --> 37:48.240
We have to leave now.

37:48.320 --> 37:51.520
- No.
- No, you can't go there. Let's go.

37:51.600 --> 37:52.680
- Stop.
- Come on, go back.

37:52.760 --> 37:53.680
Let's go.

37:55.600 --> 37:56.840
No.

37:57.600 --> 37:59.040
Don't leave.

37:59.120 --> 38:00.280
Don't leave.

38:00.360 --> 38:01.400
Are there any more?

38:01.480 --> 38:02.840
- Give it to me!
- It's mine!

38:02.920 --> 38:04.400
- It's mine.
- Give it to me!

38:05.600 --> 38:06.520
It's mine!

38:06.600 --> 38:07.560
Father,

38:08.360 --> 38:10.480
aren't you tired of reading
all these petitions?

38:11.040 --> 38:12.560
Do you want to take some rest first?

38:12.640 --> 38:16.360
Do you know the relationship
between people and officials?

38:17.200 --> 38:18.880
People are the foundation of officials.

38:18.960 --> 38:20.920
That's what the texts say.

38:22.680 --> 38:24.120
Then tell me what it is.

38:24.200 --> 38:25.480
To me, the people

38:26.120 --> 38:27.920
are just like you are to me.

38:30.680 --> 38:33.120
I like what the people like.

38:33.680 --> 38:35.320
I hate what the people hate.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.960
This is what it means
to be the father to the people.

38:38.920 --> 38:39.760
As an official,

38:40.720 --> 38:44.240
all the people are my children.

38:44.800 --> 38:46.200
Stop it!

38:46.280 --> 38:47.640
- It's mine.
- Take more.

38:47.720 --> 38:48.960
Don't!

38:51.640 --> 38:52.640
We're out of steamed buns.

38:53.240 --> 38:55.280
- We're out of steamed buns.
- It's too late, Jiang Li.

38:55.360 --> 38:57.800
The food is almost gone.
Go. Or you won't be able to leave.

38:57.880 --> 38:58.720
That's right.

38:59.800 --> 39:01.280
No.

39:01.840 --> 39:02.880
Then we'll stay.

39:02.960 --> 39:03.960
You're not leaving?

39:06.040 --> 39:08.000
- But…
- Return to the city.

39:09.400 --> 39:10.880
- Don't take mine!
- Give it to me!

39:13.560 --> 39:15.680
Don't take it! It's mine!

39:33.560 --> 39:37.200
Father, even when you're not clear-minded,

39:37.920 --> 39:39.560
you still care about the people.

39:40.640 --> 39:42.760
How could they harm someone like you?

39:44.000 --> 39:45.720
I won't let them get away with this.

39:50.560 --> 39:51.400
Jiang Li,

39:53.080 --> 39:54.640
I shouldn't have given the people food.

39:55.280 --> 39:56.840
I almost put you in danger.

39:57.440 --> 39:58.960
It's not your fault.

40:00.120 --> 40:01.680
What happened today seemed orchestrated.

40:01.760 --> 40:03.240
If they were really ordinary people,

40:03.320 --> 40:05.600
how could they know
our whereabouts so clearly?

40:05.680 --> 40:07.960
Someone might have instigated them

40:09.240 --> 40:10.560
to stop me from leaving Dingzhou.

40:10.640 --> 40:11.600
I found out

40:11.680 --> 40:13.680
there are many small paths
leading out of Dingzhou.

40:13.760 --> 40:14.960
We can go through the forest.

40:19.200 --> 40:20.600
I don't plan to leave anymore.

40:20.680 --> 40:22.040
What do you plan to do?

40:22.120 --> 40:23.760
Uncle Mingyu, you were right.

40:25.000 --> 40:26.120
They're all people.

40:26.720 --> 40:28.800
Why differentiate between those
from Huaixiang and Dingzhou?

40:30.600 --> 40:31.440
My lady.

40:32.560 --> 40:34.000
Vice Director Ye and the others are here.

40:38.680 --> 40:40.040
We're lucky to have you today.

40:41.600 --> 40:42.960
What are you two doing in Dingzhou?

40:44.240 --> 40:45.760
Li Zhongnan is here for disaster relief

40:45.840 --> 40:47.240
and His Majesty ordered me to assist him.

40:48.040 --> 40:48.920
Jiang Li,

40:49.000 --> 40:51.200
Chancellor Jiang was furious
after receiving your letter.

40:51.280 --> 40:52.600
He was going to drag you back.

40:52.680 --> 40:54.400
But when he heard
you were passing through Dingzhou,

40:54.480 --> 40:56.120
he let me come to check on you.

40:56.200 --> 40:58.080
When Father found out about this,

40:58.160 --> 40:59.720
he was fuming, right?

40:59.800 --> 41:01.720
It's good to let Uncle Yuanbai know.

41:02.200 --> 41:04.360
With so many disaster victims
and so many mouths to feed,

41:04.440 --> 41:06.840
if you don't ask for his help,
how will you solve it?

41:06.920 --> 41:07.880
Right?

41:08.360 --> 41:09.320
What can we do?

41:10.040 --> 41:12.280
Li Zhongnan is in charge
of disaster relief

41:12.360 --> 41:14.200
and the food is in his hands.

41:14.760 --> 41:15.960
Even if Father wants to help,

41:16.040 --> 41:17.120
he can't bypass Li Zhongnan.

41:17.200 --> 41:20.280
Otherwise, he'd be accused

41:20.360 --> 41:21.800
of hindering the relief efforts.

41:21.880 --> 41:24.200
Then all the more reason for you to leave.

41:24.280 --> 41:25.800
It's too late to leave now.

41:25.880 --> 41:27.960
My whereabouts have been exposed.

41:28.040 --> 41:30.200
With the disaster in Dingzhou unresolved

41:30.720 --> 41:32.360
and the people outside the city gathering,

41:32.440 --> 41:34.600
I can't leave with Magistrate Xue.

41:34.680 --> 41:36.760
Jiang Li, Luyang isn't far from here.

41:37.240 --> 41:39.200
What if I go to the Ye family
and think of a way?

41:39.280 --> 41:41.440
The Ye family
just suffered a major setback

41:41.960 --> 41:43.480
and hasn't recovered yet.

41:43.560 --> 41:45.760
Besides, gathering food
and transporting it here

41:45.840 --> 41:46.840
in such a short time

41:48.080 --> 41:49.400
is nearly impossible.

41:49.480 --> 41:51.760
The Ye family has been in business
for decades,

41:51.840 --> 41:53.280
so we're quite capable.

41:55.120 --> 41:57.120
Don't worry. I'll head back now.

42:01.040 --> 42:02.120
Be careful.

42:02.960 --> 42:04.040
- I'll get going.
- Thank you.

42:05.440 --> 42:06.920
If the Ye family can't help,

42:07.000 --> 42:08.320
it will be a dead end.

42:08.400 --> 42:11.320
Even if it's a dead end,
we need to know the reason.

42:11.400 --> 42:13.720
We already know someone is behind this,

42:14.240 --> 42:15.640
so we at least need to find out

42:15.720 --> 42:17.240
who the person behind this is.

42:20.440 --> 42:21.840
With Ms. Jiang Li in Dingzhou,

42:22.480 --> 42:24.120
all the disaster victims
are heading there.

42:25.680 --> 42:27.400
Dingzhou's situation is critical now.

42:28.080 --> 42:28.920
Minister Li,

42:29.760 --> 42:30.880
do you have any solutions?

42:30.960 --> 42:33.600
The drought has affected a wide area,

42:33.680 --> 42:34.640
spanning several cities.

42:35.440 --> 42:37.680
Right now, the disaster victims
have all gone to Dingzhou.

42:37.760 --> 42:39.840
The relief plan I made before

42:39.920 --> 42:41.040
is no longer applicable.

42:41.120 --> 42:42.400
After the imperial court meeting,

42:42.480 --> 42:44.080
I will discuss with Chancellor Jiang

42:44.160 --> 42:46.320
and quickly report a solution to you,
Your Majesty.

42:51.400 --> 42:52.480
Make haste.

42:52.560 --> 42:55.680
Every day of delay
means more suffering for the people.

42:57.760 --> 42:58.600
- Yes.
- Yes.

43:02.280 --> 43:03.200
Chancellor Li.

43:04.400 --> 43:05.240
Chancellor Li.

43:06.920 --> 43:08.200
What are you doing?

43:08.280 --> 43:11.160
We've both been doing this job
for most of our lives.

43:11.240 --> 43:12.320
A food distribution plan

43:12.400 --> 43:14.040
is already in place.

43:14.120 --> 43:16.440
It just needs to be adjusted
to fit the current situation.

43:16.520 --> 43:17.920
Must you drag this on?

43:18.000 --> 43:20.120
I'm not as anxious as you are, of course.

43:20.720 --> 43:22.200
After all, it's your daughter

43:22.280 --> 43:23.800
who caused the trouble.

43:25.480 --> 43:26.640
That's not right.

43:27.240 --> 43:30.240
The relief efforts in Dingzhou
are your responsibility.

43:30.320 --> 43:32.680
If people starve to death in Dingzhou,

43:32.760 --> 43:34.920
aren't you afraid His Majesty
will hold you accountable?

43:35.000 --> 43:36.000
Of course I am.

43:37.080 --> 43:38.840
I used to be afraid.

43:39.840 --> 43:41.840
But now, Ms. Jiang Li is there.

43:41.920 --> 43:43.120
She brought the disaster there.

43:43.200 --> 43:44.320
If His Majesty wants to punish someone,

43:44.400 --> 43:46.600
he'll start with the Jiang family.

43:46.680 --> 43:49.120
What does it have to do with me?

43:49.200 --> 43:52.360
So you don't care if people die.

43:54.080 --> 43:55.120
That's not true.

43:55.760 --> 43:58.080
There's actually a batch of grain
in Yunxiang,

43:58.600 --> 43:59.600
not far from Dingzhou.

43:59.680 --> 44:02.240
But the mountain roads are treacherous.

44:02.320 --> 44:04.280
It's not easy to transport

44:05.080 --> 44:06.280
the grain from there.

44:06.360 --> 44:08.280
Just be frank.

44:08.360 --> 44:10.480
If Ms. Jiang Li wants
to return to the capital alone,

44:10.560 --> 44:11.600
it'll be easy.

44:11.680 --> 44:13.880
But if she wants
to take someone else back,

44:13.960 --> 44:16.520
it will be a long and bumpy road.

44:17.000 --> 44:19.400
So many people gathering
on the road makes it congested.

44:19.480 --> 44:21.200
Transporting the grain
will be difficult too.

44:21.280 --> 44:23.000
Are you saying

44:23.080 --> 44:26.040
that unless she stops taking the people
to petition to His Majesty,

44:26.120 --> 44:29.440
you won't solve the famine problem?

44:29.520 --> 44:31.000
I never said that.

44:32.080 --> 44:34.160
It depends on how you interpret it,
Chancellor Jiang.

44:35.040 --> 44:36.600
But the longer this drags on,

44:36.680 --> 44:38.800
the more disaster victims
will gather in Dingzhou

44:38.880 --> 44:40.800
and the greater the danger.

44:41.440 --> 44:42.680
I suggest you go back

44:42.760 --> 44:44.640
and talk some sense into your daughter.

44:52.520 --> 44:56.440
It's said Ms. Jiang Li didn't even flinch.

44:56.520 --> 44:58.080
She stood up and said,

44:59.000 --> 45:02.200
"Justice is evident and should prevail.

45:02.280 --> 45:04.960
Is there no place for justice?

45:06.040 --> 45:09.080
If these grievances
can't be addressed in Huaixiang

45:09.640 --> 45:11.440
and Luyang can't help,

45:11.520 --> 45:13.560
then follow me, folks.

45:13.640 --> 45:15.920
Even if the path ahead
is filled with danger,

45:16.000 --> 45:19.280
I will take you to the capital

45:19.960 --> 45:21.640
to petition to His Majesty!"

45:21.720 --> 45:22.680
Nice!

45:23.640 --> 45:24.760
Your Highness…

45:29.440 --> 45:30.720
Well said.

45:31.880 --> 45:33.640
- Reward him.
- Reward him.

45:37.960 --> 45:39.200
Chancellor Li.

45:39.960 --> 45:40.800
Yes, Your Highness.

45:40.880 --> 45:42.920
You've mastered

45:43.000 --> 45:44.600
the art of using rumors.

45:45.520 --> 45:49.280
You sure know how to exploit
the common folks' love for drama.

45:49.360 --> 45:50.520
Thank you for your praise.

45:50.600 --> 45:53.160
I'm simply giving them
a taste of their own medicine.

45:53.240 --> 45:55.680
Doesn't Jiang Li love to use her name

45:55.760 --> 45:57.400
to spread her cause?

45:57.480 --> 45:59.680
This time, I'll let her use it
to her heart's content.

46:01.320 --> 46:02.880
Those whom the gods wish to destroy,

46:04.680 --> 46:06.600
they first make mad.
